## 7. Maturity Model

### Emerging
Conceptually developed but not field tested.

### Developing
Applied in several cases with preliminary consistency.

### Established
Validated across multiple communities and stakeholder groups.

### Stewarded
Supported by formal governance, revision, training, version control, and longitudinal evidence.

## 8. Design Rule

Use the smallest instrument set necessary for the question.

Not every community review requires all eight instruments.
